3e\\u003ch2\\u003eFAQ\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat is the pixel pitch of the PoolView P3.9 and how does it affect image quality?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe PoolView P3.9 features a 3.9mm pixel pitch, which offers a high-resolution display suitable for close-to-moderate viewing distances typical in outdoor home cinema setups. This pixel pitch ensures sharp, detailed images for an immersive viewing experience.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eIs the PoolView P3.9 suitable for outdoor use in extreme weather conditions?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYes, the PoolView P3.9 has an IP65 rating, making it fully weather-proof against dust and water. It is designed to withstand Dubai’s extreme heat, humidity, sandstorms, and direct sunlight, operating efficiently between -20°C to 60°C.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow bright is the PoolView P3.9, and will it perform well in daylight?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThis model offers a peak brightness of 5000 nits, ensuring vibrant and clear visuals even under direct sunlight. The anti-glare coating further enhances outdoor visibility, making it ideal for bright poolside or garden environments.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat installation options are available for the PoolView P3.9?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe PoolView P3.9 supports both retractable and fixed mounting options, allowing flexibility according to your outdoor space setup. This makes it easy to install on walls, poolside structures, or rooftop terraces.\\u003c/p\\u003e14:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$15\\\"}}]\\nb:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\n8:null\\nd:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"PoolView P3.9 - Weatherproof Poolside LED Display Dubai UAE | Brightluxx\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\"