s Extended Available\"}]}10:Tc0c,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the PoolView P3.9 and how does it affect image quality?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The PoolView P3.9 features a 3.9mm pixel pitch, which offers a high-resolution display suitable for close-to-moderate viewing distances typical in outdoor home cinema setups. This pixel pitch ensures sharp, detailed images for an immersive viewing experience.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the PoolView P3.9 suitable for outdoor use in extreme weather conditions?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the PoolView P3.9 has an IP65 rating, making it fully weather-proof against dust and water. It is designed to withstand Dubai\\u2019s extreme heat, humidity, sandstorms, and direct sunlight, operating efficiently between -20\\u00b0C to 60\\u00b0C.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright is the PoolView P3.9, and will it perform well in daylight?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This model offers a peak brightness of 5000 nits, ensuring vibrant and clear visuals even under direct sunlight. The anti-glare coating further enhances outdoor visibility, making it ideal for bright poolside or garden environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What installation options are available for the PoolView P3.9?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The PoolView P3.9 supports both retractable and fixed mounting options, allowing flexibility according to your outdoor space setup. This makes it easy to install on walls, poolside structures, or rooftop terraces.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does PoolView P3.9 compare to traditional projector systems for outdoor use?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike projectors, PoolView P3.9 offers direct-view LED technology with higher brightness, weather resistance, and no need for a dark environment or a screen. It delivers superior image quality in daylight with minimal maintenance.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and support services does Brightluxx offer for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx provides a comprehensive warranty covering parts and workmanship, along with dedicated after-sales support to ensure the longevity and optimal functioning of your PoolView P3.9 display.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What sizes are available for the PoolView P3.9 and can it be customized?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"PoolView P3.9 is offered in multiple sizes including 100\\\", 120\\\", 150\\\", and 200\\\" diagonals. Custom sizes may also be available upon request to fit specific outdoor living spaces.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the PoolView P3.9 energy efficient for continuous outdoor use?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it\\u2019s designed using advanced LED technology that balances high brightness with energy efficiency, making it suitable for extended viewing without excessive power consumption.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"PoolView P3.9\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/poolview-p39\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n13:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n15:T791,<h1>PoolView P3.9</h1><p>Shop PoolView P3.9 weatherproof LED displays for poolside in Dubai. Brightluxx UAE offers durable, stunning outdoor LED screens. Call now!</p><p><strong>Weather-proof outdoor cinema for poolside and gardens.</strong></p><p>PoolView brings cinema-quality viewing to outdoor living spaces. IP65-rated panels withstand Dubai's extreme heat, humidity, sandstorms, and direct sun. Anti-glare coating and 5000 nits peak brightness ensure vibrant image quality even in bright daylight. Retractable or fixed mounting options. Perfect for villa gardens, rooftop terraces, and resort pool areas across the GCC.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the PoolView P3.9 and how does it affect image quality?</h3><p>The PoolView P3.9 features a 3.9mm pixel pitch, which offers a high-resolution display suitable for close-to-moderate viewing distances typical in outdoor home cinema setups. This pixel pitch ensures sharp, detailed images for an immersive viewing experience.</p><h3>Is the PoolView P3.9 suitable for outdoor use in extreme weather conditions?</h3><p>Yes, the PoolView P3.9 has an IP65 rating, making it fully weather-proof against dust and water. It is designed to withstand Dubai’s extreme heat, humidity, sandstorms, and direct sunlight, operating efficiently between -20°C to 60°C.</p><h3>How bright is the PoolView P3.9, and will it perform well in daylight?</h3><p>This model offers a peak brightness of 5000 nits, ensuring vibrant and clear visuals even under direct sunlight. The anti-glare coating further enhances outdoor visibility, making it ideal for bright poolside or garden environments.</p><h3>What installation options are available for the PoolView P3.9?</h3><p>The PoolView P3.9 supports both retractable and fixed mounting options, allowing flexibility according to your outdoor space setup. This makes it easy to install on walls, poolside structures, or rooftop terraces.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"PoolView P3.9 - Weatherproof Poolside LED Display Dubai UAE | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Shop PoolView P3.9 weatherproof LED displays for poolside in Dubai. Brightluxx UAE offers durable, stunning outdoor LED screens. Call now!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/poolview-p39\"}]]\n","/$c$slug/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:T606,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Product\", \"name\": \"PoolView P3.9\", \"description\": \"PoolView brings cinema-quality viewing to outdoor living spaces. IP65-rated panels withstand Dubai's extreme heat, humidity, sandstorms, and direct sun. Anti-glare coating and 5000 nits peak brightness ensure vibrant image quality even in bright daylight. Retractable or fixed mounting options. Perfect for villa gardens, rooftop terraces, and resort pool areas across the GCC.\", \"sku\": \"BL-HC-PV39\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/product